### Food plan
POST http://localhost:8090/api/smart-plan/food
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "destination": "Goa",
  "startDate": "2026-10-12",
  "endDate": "2026-10-14",
  "diet": "veg",
  "cuisines": ["indian", "cafe"],
  "maxPerMeal": 700
}
### Replan because of crowds
POST http://localhost:8090/api/smart-plan/replan
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "crowd",
  "plan": {
    "destination": "Goa",
    "startDate": "2026-10-12",
    "endDate": "2026-10-14",
    "maxHotelPerNight": 5000,
    "amenities": ["wifi"],
    "nearAttractions": true,
    "pace": "explore",
    "interests": ["culture"]
  }
}
### Traveler 1
POST http://localhost:8090/api/smart-plan/connect
Content-Type: application/json

{ "displayName": "Ravi", "destination": "Goa", "startDate": "2026-10-12", "endDate": "2026-10-16",
  "interests": ["beaches", "food", "photography"], "pace": "explore" }
### Traveler 2
POST http://localhost:8090/api/smart-plan/connect
Content-Type: application/json

{ "displayName": "Anita", "destination": "Goa", "startDate": "2026-10-14", "endDate": "2026-10-18",
  "interests": ["food", "trekking"], "pace": "explore" }

### Ravi sends a request to Anita
# Ravi's id = dfcc3df8, Anita's id = 4fc46260
POST http://localhost:8090/api/smart-plan/connect/dfcc3df8/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "toId": "4fc46260",
  "message": "Hi, want to explore the old town together on the 15th?"
}

### Anita's requests (copy the request id from the response)
GET http://localhost:8090/api/smart-plan/connect/8f1bbda3/requests

### Anita accepts (paste the request id in the URL)
POST http://localhost:8090/api/smart-plan/connect/requests/7b7968f2/respond
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "responderId": "520f8e71",
  "decision": "accept"
}

### Ravi's matches
GET http://localhost:8090/api/smart-plan/connect/c7f0ff6b/matches